# 生存中键选块购买 — 全体玩家默认可用
# 中键购买通过玩家执行 /shop quickbuy，需 ultimateshop.quickbuy（插件默认仅 OP）

function mcwwsGrantPickBlockBuyPerms():
    if plugin "LuckPerms" is enabled:
        execute console command "lp group default permission set mcwws.shop.pickbuy true"
        execute console command "lp group default permission set ultimateshop.quickbuy true"
        log "[MCWWS] 已为 default 组授予选块购买权限 (mcwws.shop.pickbuy + ultimateshop.quickbuy)"

on Skript start:
    wait 5 seconds
    mcwwsGrantPickBlockBuyPerms()

on script load:
    wait 2 seconds
    mcwwsGrantPickBlockBuyPerms()
